# Picki adapters

Core modules under `apps/api/src/modules/` depend on **ports** in `@picki/shared`, never vendor SDKs.

- Implementations: `apps/api/src/integrations/{identity,notifications,payments,geo}/`
- Vendor HTTP: `/v1/integrations/{vendor}/*` only
- Business APIs: `/v1/orders`, `/v1/zones`, `/v1/providers`, …

```ts
// ❌ BAD
import { ZaloPay } from "zalopay-sdk";

// ✅ GOOD
await paymentService.createIntent({ pickiPaymentId, amountVnd });
```

Map external IDs in `user_identities`. Never use Zalo UID as `users.id`.

No Grab/ShopeeFood/Google Maps scraping or import in V1 (ADR-027).
